  "body": "### Description\n\nSpace's room list through federation don't display all available rooms\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- go to [#monnaie-libre:matrix.org](https://matrix.to/#/#monnaie-libre:matrix.org) where it is supposed to have 16 rooms (an admin of the space told me that) but I can see only 4 of them from my account (from an other synapse server than [matrix.org](http://matrix.org/), my own yunohost synapse server).\r\n- If I go to [#community:matrix.org](https://matrix.to/#/#community:matrix.org) space, the list of room is very long but I can't be sure if all are listed.\r\n- If I go to [#monnaie-libre:matrix.org](https://matrix.to/#/#monnaie-libre:matrix.org) from a matrix.org account, it indeed shows me a list of 15 rooms (might mean that 1 of the room isn't public or that the admin of the space made a mistake)\r\n- If I go to [#monnaie-libre:matrix.org](https://matrix.to/#/#monnaie-libre:matrix.org) from a defis.info account, it shows me only 4 available room\r\n\n\n### Homeserver\n\nleprette.fr, defis.info and matrix.org\n\n### Synapse Version\n\nleprette.fr  : 1.59, defis.info : 1.59.1\n\n### Installation Method\n\nDebian packages from packages.matrix.org\n\n### Platform\n\nleprette.fr : Yunohost package\r\ndefis.info : Debian packages in a proxmox container behind an nginx reverse proxy\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\ndo not know\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
